UR  - https://discover.lshtm.ac.uk/openurl/44HYG/44HYG_services_page?sid=OVID:embase&id=doi:10.1101%2F2025.02.14.638223&id=pmid&issn=2692-8205&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2025&title=bioRxiv&atitle=Aedes+albopictus+is+rapidly+invading+its+climatic+niche+in+France%3A+wider+implications+for+biting+nuisance+and+arbovirus+control+in+Western+Europe&aulast=Radici&pid=%3Cauthor%3ERadici+A.%3BHammami+P.%3BCannet+A.%3BL%27Ambert+G.%3BLacour+G.%3BFournet+F.%3BGarros+C.%3BGuis+H.%3BFontenille+D.%3BCaminade+C.%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E2037990429%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EPreprint%3C%2FDT%3E
