T1  - Leveraging probabilistic forecasts for dengue preparedness and control: the 2024 Dengue Forecasting Sprint in Brazil
A1  - Araujo E.C.
A1  - Carvalho L.M.
A1  - Ganem F.
A1  - Vacaro L.B.
A1  - Bastos L.S.
