T1  - Evaluation of an open forecasting challenge to assess skill of West Nile virus neuroinvasive disease prediction
A1  - Holcomb K.M.
A1  - Mathis S.
A1  - Staples J.E.
A1  - Fischer M.
A1  - Barker C.M.
A1  - Beard C.B.
A1  - Nett R.J.
A1  - Keyel A.C.
