T1  - Predicting 30 Day Return Hospital Admissions in Patients with COVID-19 Discharged from the Emergency Department: A national retrospective cohort study
T3  - Association for Clinical and Translational Science, ACTS 2022. Chicago, IL United States.
A1  - Beiser D.
