T1  - Predicting Prolonged Hospitalization and Supplemental Oxygenation in Patients with COVID-19 Infection from Ambulatory Chest Radiographs using Deep Learning
A1  - Pyrros A.
A1  - Flanders A.E.
A1  - Rodriguez-Fernandez J.M.
