T1  - Predicting spatial patterns of sindbis virus (Sinv) infection risk in finland using vector, host and environmental data
A1  - Uusitalo R.
A1  - Siljander M.
A1  - Culverwell C.L.
A1  - Hendrickx G.
A1  - Linden A.
A1  - Dub T.
A1  - Aalto J.
