T1  - A Blueprint for High Affinity SARS-CoV-2 Mpro Inhibitors from Activity-Based Compound Library Screening Guided by Analysis of Protein Dynamics
A1  - Gossen J.
A1  - Albani S.
A1  - Hanke A.
A1  - Joseph B.P.
A1  - Bergh C.
A1  - Kuzikov M.
A1  - Costanzi E.
A1  - Manelfi C.
A1  - Storici P.
