T1  - Monthly variation in the probability of presence of adult Culicoides populations in nine European countries and the implications for targeted surveillance
A1  - Cuellar A.C.
A1  - Jung Kjaer L.
A1  - Baum A.
A1  - Stockmarr A.
A1  - Skovgard H.
A1  - Nielsen So.A.
A1  - Andersson M.G.
