T1  - Hepatitis C virus (HCV) infection and pathogenesis: From systems biology to translational research
T3  - 61st Annual Meeting of the American Association for the Study of Liver Diseases: The Liver Meeting 2010. Boston, MA United States.
A1  - Diamond D.L.
A1  - Rasmussen A.L.
A1  - Susnow N.J.
A1  - Datta S.
A1  - Magaret C.
