T1  - Annotation of potential vaccine targets and design of a multi-epitope subunit vaccine against Yersinia pestis through reverse vaccinology and validation through an agent-based modeling approach.

A1  - Haq, Azaz Ul
A1  - Khan, Abbas
A1  - Khan, Jafar
A1  - Irum, Shamaila
A1  - Waheed, Yasir
A1  - Ahmad, Sajjad
A1  - Nizam-Uddin, N.
