T1  - BIO-CXRNET: a robust multimodal stacking machine learning technique for mortality risk prediction of COVID-19 patients using chest X-ray images and clinical data.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00521-023-08606-w
A1  - Rahman, Tawsifur
A1  - Chowdhury, Muhammad E H
A1  - Khandakar, Amith
