T1  - SCLAVOEM: hyper parameter optimization approach to predictive modelling of COVID-19 infodemic tweets using smote and classifier vote ensemble.
T3  - Retraction in: Soft comput. 2024;28(Suppl 1):101. doi: 10.1007/s00500-024-10010-y PMID: 39847677 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39847677]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00500-022-06940-0
A1  - Olaleye, Taiwo
A1  - Abayomi-Alli, Adebayo
