T1  - Optimization using the firefly algorithm of ensemble neural networks with type-2 fuzzy integration for COVID-19 time series prediction.
T3  - Retraction in: Soft comput. 2024;28(Suppl 1):71. doi: 10.1007/s00500-024-09995-3 PMID: 39847673 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39847673]
