T1  - Ensemble learning for multi-class COVID-19 detection from big data.
T3  - Retraction in: PLoS One. 2025 Apr 7;20(4):e0321416. doi: 10.1371/journal.pone.0321416. PMID: 40193821 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40193821]
