T1  - Predicting the Potential Global Distribution of the Plum Fruit Moth Grapholita funebrana Treitscheke Using Ensemble Models.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3390/insects15090663
A1  - Yang, Mingsheng
A1  - Huo, Yiqi
A1  - Wang, Lei
