T1  - Supporting COVID-19 policy-making with a predictive epidemiological multi-model warning system.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s43856-022-00219-z
A1  - Bicher, Martin
A1  - Zuba, Martin
A1  - Rainer, Lukas
A1  - Bachner, Florian
