T1  - Homogeneous ensemble models for predicting infection levels and mortality of COVID-19 patients: Evidence from China.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1177/20552076221133692
A1  - Wang, Jiafeng
A1  - Zhou, Xianlong
A1  - Hou, Zhitian
