T1  - COVID-19 and Artificial Intelligence: An Approach to Forecast the Severity of Diagnosis.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3390/life11111281
A1  - Udristoiu, Anca Loredana
A1  - Ghenea, Alice Elena
A1  - Udristoiu, Stefan
