T1  - A super learner ensemble of 14 statistical learning models for predicting COVID-19 severity among patients with cardiovascular conditions.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.ibmed.2021.100030
A1  - Ehwerhemuepha, Louis
A1  - Danioko, Sidy
A1  - Verma, Shiva
